+/// A digest cache for the structural key, keyed by node address and scoped to
+/// the level that owns the nodes.
+///
+/// The key is composed rather than streamed ([`expr_digest`]), so a node's
+/// digest is a function of its children's. That alone still visits every node,
+/// because nothing identifies a node well enough to reuse a digest across two
+/// calls -- SWC's `Expr` carries no node id, and its span is not an identity
