+/// hashing and [`truncate`](Self::truncate)s back to it afterwards; every entry
+/// recorded in between belongs to a node reachable from the expression that
+/// call was handed, which outlives the call. Nothing dead is kept and nothing
+/// live is dropped, and a node synthesized at a sibling level cannot inherit a
+/// freed node's entry.
+///
